flowchart TD
    Start([Start Sentiment Analysis]) --> Load[Load: preprocessed_data.csv]
    
    Load --> BuildLex[Build Sentiment Lexicon]
    
    BuildLex --> Positive[Create: positive_lexicon<br/>- 300-500 positive words<br/>- Weight: 1-3]
    BuildLex --> Negative[Create: negative_lexicon<br/>- 300-500 negative words<br/>- Weight: 1-3]
    
    Positive --> ExamplePos["Examples:<br/>bagus (2), hebat (3),<br/>inovatif (2), transparan (2),<br/>revolusioner (3)"]
    Negative --> ExampleNeg["Examples:<br/>penipuan (3), rugi (3),<br/>berbahaya (3), kompleks (1),<br/>membingungkan (2)"]
    
    ExamplePos --> Process
    ExampleNeg --> Process
    
    Process[Process Each Comment] --> Tokenize[Tokenize Comment]
    Tokenize --> MatchPos[Match Positive Words<br/>Sum weights]
    Tokenize --> MatchNeg[Match Negative Words<br/>Sum weights]
    
    MatchPos --> CalcScore[Calculate Sentiment Score<br/>Score = Sum positive - Sum negative]
    MatchNeg --> CalcScore
    
    CalcScore --> Classify{Classify Sentiment}
    
    Classify -->|Score > 0| LabelPos[Label: POSITIVE]
    Classify -->|Score = 0| LabelNeu[Label: NEUTRAL]
    Classify -->|Score < 0| LabelNeg[Label: NEGATIVE]
    
    LabelPos --> Save
    LabelNeu --> Save
    LabelNeg --> Save
    
    Save[Save Results] --> Output[Output: sentiment_results.csv]
    Output --> Stats[Generate Statistics<br/>- Distribution<br/>- Average scores<br/>- Per topic breakdown]
    
    Stats --> End([Sentiment Analysis Complete])
    
